msgid "文档编写"
msgstr "Writing documentation"

msgid ""
"现行手册位于 Documentation/，使用 UTF-8 RST、显式 toctree 与 Sphinx。 "
"文档标题等号上下线，章用等号、节用横线、子节用波浪线。保持纯文本可读， 代码使用字面块，交叉引用使用 doc/ref。按管理员、构建、内部 API、用户"
" API 和开发流程组织，不把聊天、阶段日志和历史计划混入操作手册。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the current manuals in Documentation/, using UTF-8 RST, explicit "
"toctrees and Sphinx. Surround document titles with equals signs; use equals "
"signs for chapters, hyphens for sections and tildes for subsections. Keep "
"plain text readable, use literal blocks for code and doc/ref roles for "
"cross-references. Organize the manuals by administration, building, internal"
" APIs, user APIs and development processes. Do not mix chats, stage logs or "
"historical plans into operational manuals."

msgid ""
"根 README.rst 是入口，AGENT 与许可文件按职责保留。公开声明以导出的 UAPI 和真实实现为依据，不为文档生成改变代码语义。 "
"内核手册只在本仓维护，ReliefOS 的桌面、应用和系统集成手册由主仓维护。 ReliefOS 的 Pages/RPR 网站读取本仓文档生成独立的 "
"docs/reliefnt/ 入口； 不用在主仓保存另一份内核源文档。"
msgstr ""
"The root README.rst is the entry point; AGENT and license files retain their"
" own roles. Base public claims on exported UAPI and actual implementations, "
"and do not change code semantics for documentation generation. Maintain the "
"kernel manual only in this repository; ReliefOS desktop, application and "
"system-integration manuals belong to the parent repository. The ReliefOS "
"Pages/RPR website reads this repository to generate a separate "
"docs/reliefnt/ entry point; do not maintain another copy of the kernel "
"document sources in the parent repository."

msgid ""
"使用 Sphinx 5.3 至 9.x，在本仓运行 ``make O=out/docs htmldocs``； 输出为 "
"O/Documentation/html。构建将警告作为错误，必须解决未引用页面、语法 和失效交叉引用。HTML 使用 "
"Alabaster，可离线阅读，不加载 JavaScript。 简体中文是源语言及默认入口，英文位于输出的 en/，日文位于 ja/；每页的 "
"语言导航切换到另一语言的同名页面。既有中文地址保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Use Sphinx 5.3 through 9.x and run ``make O=out/docs htmldocs`` in this "
"repository. Output goes to O/Documentation/html. The build treats warnings "
"as errors: fix pages omitted from the contents, syntax errors and broken "
"cross-references. HTML uses Alabaster, works offline and loads no "
"JavaScript. Simplified Chinese is the source language and default entry "
"point; English is under en/ and Japanese under ja/ in the output. Each page "
"has language links to the same page in the other languages. Existing Chinese"
" URLs remain unchanged."

msgid "翻译维护"
msgstr "Maintaining translations"

msgid ""
"英文和日文 PO 按页面完整路径存放在 "
"``Documentation/locale/{en,ja}/LC_MESSAGES/<docname>.po``，例如 "
"``Documentation/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/process/documentation.po``。 配置使用 "
"``gettext_compact = False``，每个页面独立提取消息。 HTML 构建复制 locale 到临时输出后编译 "
"MO，不修改源码中的翻译目录。"
msgstr ""
"Store English and Japanese PO files by the full document path at "
"``Documentation/locale/{en,ja}/LC_MESSAGES/<docname>.po``, for example "
"``Documentation/locale/ja/LC_MESSAGES/process/documentation.po``. The "
"configuration uses ``gettext_compact = False`` to extract messages "
"separately for each page. HTML builds copy locale into temporary output "
"before compiling MO files, leaving the translation directory in the source "
"tree unchanged."

msgid "本仓独立提供以下入口，只运行文档工具，不编译内核::"
msgstr ""
"This repository independently provides the following entry points, which run"
" documentation tools without compiling the kernel::"

msgid ""
"Make 目标将 POT 输出到 ``O/Documentation/gettext/``。脚本默认只提取模板， 显式 ``--update`` "
"才初始化或合并英文、日文 PO，保留译文与译者注释，近似匹配 标记为 fuzzy。维护工具使用 Sphinx 已有的 Babel，无需新增依赖。 "
"``--check`` 按当前源码重新提取模板，只读检查全部 PO；缺页、缺消息、缺译、 "
"fuzzy、过期消息及含中文原文整段照抄均失败，不能以中文回退充当译文。 每次提取替换旧 POT，已删除页面不会遗留模板。"
msgstr ""
"Make targets write POT files to ``O/Documentation/gettext/``. By default the"
" script only extracts templates. Only an explicit ``--update`` initializes "
"or merges English and Japanese PO files, preserving translations and "
"translator comments and marking approximate matches fuzzy. The maintenance "
"tool uses Babel, already supplied with Sphinx, so no new dependency is "
"needed. ``--check`` extracts templates from the current source and checks "
"all PO files without modifying them. Missing pages or messages, missing "
"translations, fuzzy entries, obsolete messages and entire passages copied "
"unchanged from Chinese fail the check; Chinese fallback cannot stand in for "
"a translation. Each extraction replaces old POT files, so deleted pages "
"leave no templates."

msgid ""
"纯英文命令和路径允许与原文相同。需要保留原文的中文技术词或日文同形词， 在本仓 "
"``Documentation/locale/identical.json`` 按语言登记完整 msgid，例如::"
msgstr ""
"Plain English commands and paths may match the source. For Chinese technical"
" terms or Japanese terms written identically to the source that must remain "
"unchanged, register the full msgid for the appropriate language in this "
"repository's ``Documentation/locale/identical.json``, for example::"

msgid ""
"白名单必须恰好包含 ``en``、``ja`` 两个键，值为不重复的非空字符串数组。 按完整 msgid "
"精确匹配，不支持模糊匹配或通配；日文例外不用于英文。 ``gettext-check`` 与 ``htmldocs`` "
"预检默认读取同一文件，删除例外后同形译文 会再次检查失败。``--allow-identical '术语'`` 仅为本次 CLI 检查临时添加两种语言 "
"共用的例外，不修改持久白名单。行号与提取时间变化不算译文过期。"
msgstr ""
"The allowlist must contain exactly the keys ``en`` and ``ja``, each with an "
"array of unique, nonempty strings. It matches complete msgids exactly, with "
"no fuzzy matches or wildcards; Japanese exceptions do not apply to English. "
"``gettext-check`` and the ``htmldocs`` preflight read the same file by "
"default. Removing an exception makes the unchanged translation fail again. "
"``--allow-identical '术语'`` adds an exception shared by both languages only "
"for the current CLI check and does not modify the persistent allowlist. "
"Changes to line numbers and extraction times do not make a translation "
"stale."

msgid ""
"``htmldocs``、``gettext``、``gettext-check`` 通过 ``scripts/docs-python.sh`` "
"共用解释器选择：显式非空 ``DOCS_PYTHON`` 优先，否则依次选择 ``SPHINXBUILD`` 所在目录的 "
"``python``、``python3``，均不存在时才使用 PATH 中的 ``python3``。 只设置 "
"``SPHINXBUILD=/path/to/venv/bin/sphinx-build`` 即可使用该虚拟环境的 Babel；可用 "
"``DOCS_PYTHON=/path/to/python`` 显式覆盖。直接运行 Python 维护 脚本时，仍需激活相同环境或显式选择该环境的 "
"Python。"
msgstr ""
"``htmldocs``, ``gettext`` and ``gettext-check`` share interpreter selection "
"through ``scripts/docs-python.sh``. An explicitly nonempty ``DOCS_PYTHON`` "
"takes precedence. Otherwise the script tries ``python`` and then ``python3``"
" in the directory containing ``SPHINXBUILD``, using ``python3`` from PATH "
"only if neither exists. Setting only ``SPHINXBUILD=/path/to/venv/bin/sphinx-"
"build`` is enough to use that virtual environment's Babel. Use "
"``DOCS_PYTHON=/path/to/python`` for an explicit override. When running the "
"Python maintenance script directly, activate the same environment or "
"explicitly select its Python."

msgid ""
"格式参考 `Linux 文档指南 <https://docs.kernel.org/doc-guide/sphinx.html>`_。 "
"完整测试与平台范围见 :doc:`testing` 及 :doc:`../admin-guide/limitations`。"
msgstr ""
"For formatting, refer to the `Linux documentation guide "
"<https://docs.kernel.org/doc-guide/sphinx.html>`_. See :doc:`testing` and "
":doc:`../admin-guide/limitations` for complete test and platform coverage."
